									Playtime in Charasis - 
									4/5/2005 1:51:32 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p><strong>Howling Stones...</strong><br />Nice little zone to play in... don't forget to take a CoH magician hehe.&nbsp; Here's a screenshot or 2 of what we all stayed up so late last night playing with.&nbsp; It was fun, easy, late.. perfect fights for my return from sick-land!<br /><br /></p><img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/fabledfeaster-hs.jpg" /><br />&nbsp;<img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/fabledspectre-hs.jpg" /> <p>The rewards: <br /></p> <p align="center"><img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/FabledSteelHiltedFlintDagger.jpg" /> <img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/FabledSashoftheDragonborn.jpg" /></p>
								</div>
