									PoSky - 
									3/26/2005 12:18:07 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/posky.jpg" /><br /><br />So, when Gorg agroed early on us, it was Tribular to the rescue!&nbsp; He walked right up to that mean old bird and turned his back on it!&nbsp; It might've been appropriate to yell at that point "We're not afraid of you!" but, sadly, noone thought of it.<br />Tribular and Malulani held Gorgalosk at bay, keeping it between 32% and 43% for a very long time.&nbsp; Many thanks for saving our rears!&nbsp; Gratz to all who got some of their keys. On our last encounter, the big scary mob was neither big nor scary and went down real fast.&nbsp; /flex
								</div>
