									CoM-Chardok-Fabled Mobs - 
									3/19/2005 2:04:52 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/Fabledchardokprince.jpg" /><br /><br />*waves goodbye to the Fabled Prince Selrach Di'Zok*<br /><br />Woot!&nbsp; Thank you to Eigen and Jade Dragon for taking us to kill several fabled mobs tonight.&nbsp; Thanks also to Vert from XTC and Pudan, of course! =)<br />Eigen did a good job of leading us through killing not one, not two, but 5 fabled mobs tonight between Chardok and CoM! Here are some screenshots of some of the loot. Gratz to all who got upgrades tonight.&nbsp; <br /><br /><img alt="Image hosted by Photobucket.com" src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Raids/fabledloot.jpg" /></p>
